{"id": "De_UEiIP34p", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"AGENCY\" to get these 4 free plugins that can fully run your agency or business inside Claude Code.\n\nYour Claude Code can now run your agency for you.\n\nAll you need is these 4 free plugins.\n\nFirst is Google Maps Scraper.\n\nYou tell it a city and the type of business you want to target.\n\nIt scrapes every lead in your area into a clean list.\n\nEach one comes with a name, phone, email and address.\n\nSecond is Agency Agents.\n\nIt turns Claude Code into a full agency with over 200 AI employees.\n\nSales agents write your cold emails.\n\nMarketers plan your campaigns.\n\nEngineers build the actual work.\n\nIt has already crossed 160K stars on GitHub.\n\nThird is LinkedIn Skills.\n\nIt's a pack of 12 skills that writes your posts, comments and replies in your own voice.\n\nSo clients start coming to you instead of you chasing them.\n\nAnd finally there's OpenSEO.\n\nIt's an open source alternative to Ahrefs and Semrush.\n\nIt handles your keyword research and rank tracking.\n\nSo your business ranks higher in search results.\n\n#AIplugins #claudecode #openseo #linkedinskills #agencyagents", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1793085930, "like_count": 1368, "comment_count": 2234, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1434931032120430a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.268, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOS12rWFWKg6wC7EX3vbJmDnavQCcqvFS6SHr6_wIL747c86D8oKkpMkd1fJccVicvOilu_63T4nrdJa8nGhj3u2eeCNT2VnD6HJV0.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=AdpgvaZqaVJlqBdCoW3BwTcLmnUBPKNywHksO-51YbhjJl-IuoaQYIyT8q-34yhKMiA&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=Jyx9uQbJHfgQ7kNvwHnsgiY&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=EZqNTk1sMriI0ayioBjhWA&_nc_ss=70a8c&_nc_map=